<h2>Password Recovery</h2>

<p>Hello {{name}},</p>

<p>
    A password recovery request has been initiated for your account.
</p>

<p>
    To set a new password, please follow the link below:
</p>

<p>
    <a href="{{recoveryLink}}">
        Reset your password
    </a>
</p>

<p>
    This link is valid for 30 minutes.
</p>

<p>
    If you did not request a password reset, please ignore this email.
    No changes will be made to your account unless you complete the process.
</p>
